<h2>Execution Modes</h2>
<p>OMC offers several execution modes to match the nature of the work. Think of each mode as a way of deciding "how the work will proceed". Modes are easiest to understand as an intensity spectrum, from light one-off tasks to large, autonomous ones.</p>

<p><strong>Intensity spectrum (weak → strong):</strong> conversation (single query) → plan (drawing up a plan) → autopilot (autonomous execution) → ralph (repeat until done) → team ralph (team + repetition)</p>

