<div class="note">
    <span class="nh">The containment relation of the three modes — autopilot ⊃ ralph ⊃ ultrawork</span>
    ultrawork is a part that handles only parallel execution, ralph puts persistent execution · story tracking · completion verification on top of it, and autopilot puts the whole pipeline of requirements analysis · design · QA · multi-angle verification on top of that again. So you can choose with <strong>"ulw if you only need parallelism, ralph if you need a completion guarantee, autopilot if you want to hand it over from start to finish"</strong>.
</div>

